OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over 'dangerously out of
OL,4,Acontrol' dogs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police warning has been issued over a
OL,7,Frise in dogs being "dangerously out of
OL,8,Fcontrol" in rural Nottinghamshire.
OL,10,FRushcliffe South police beat team said
OL,11,Fit had recently dealt with six
OL,12,Fincidents of dogs injuring people and
OL,13,Fone killing a sheep.
OL,15,FThe injuries were caused in Thoroton,
OL,16,FEast Leake, Sutton Bonnington,
OL,17,FHawksworth and twice in Ruddington,
OL,18,Fwhile the sheep was killed near East
OL,19,FBridgford between Sunday and Monday,
OL,20,Fofficers added.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
