OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over 'dangerously out of
OL,4,Acontrol' dogs
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the beat team said:
OL,7,F"All of these incidents could [have
OL,8,Fbeen] prevented if those walking the
OL,9,Fdogs or in charge of them had them
OL,10,Funder proper control."
